<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunkers stable, 380-cst at $103-$105/T.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunkers stable, 380-cst at $103-$105/T.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore bunker prices were quoted within Monday's range with enquiries seen rising as shipowners absent a day ago return to cover their requirements, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Bunker 380-cst was quoted at $104-$105 by some majors with others indicating $103. Bunker 180-cst was quoted at $110.</p>
<p>Bunker sellers said prices maybe pushed higher later Tuesday as demand was healthy.</p>
<p>A trader said &quot;shipowners were taking their time for too long and now they have decided that prices are right and they need to buy before levels climb again.&quot;</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3086)</p>
